// A host Newton that receives a beam, "Northbound", over the LAN medium,
// as the In Box's Receive does, and ends when it is in its In Box (with
// beam-lan-send.ns: one of two listening newtons).
HostInclude("beamhelpers.ns");
call beamReceiveNote with ("Northbound", func(e) begin
	Print("beam-lan-listen: received");
	HostQuit();
end);
